# The portfolio is a single-page shell whose in-app navigation is mirrored into
# real URLs (/projects, /about+contact, /split/a+b) so Back, Forward and deep
# links work. The build emits only index.html, so every one of those paths has to
# be served it and routed client-side.
#
# 200 (rewrite), not 301/302 — the URL must survive so the shell can read it.
# Cloudflare Pages matches Functions (/api/*) and real static assets BEFORE this
# rule, so the contact endpoint, fonts, wallpapers and resume.pdf are unaffected.
/*  /index.html  200
